"1688858421799034","messageRemoteId":"1035156","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"孩子的语文下降了，怎样叫他学会呢，数学可以，英语也可以，就是语文愁头","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773753254,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1032646","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"老师夸孩子的语音咱们可以放给孩子听哦，我也会持续为孩子的学习保驾护航，孩子后续任何问题，您都一定记得跟我说哈~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773657305,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1032644","content":{"messageType":14,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"bigPicture":{"url":"https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/7117909_do0_md5_2e3dd0a6b38f84374c7d1e6c2392d766.jpg","md5":"2e3dd0a6b38f84374c7d1e6c2392d766","size":248867},"smallPicture":null,"contentType":"PICTURE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773657301,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1032642","content":{"messageType":16,"flag":0,"senderName":null,"time":0,"url":"https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-encoder/audio/373ef3f0/373ef3f0-1cde-4bd2-9731-ff715c9ea503.amr","md5":"4de276f8c44da1e3c34943d5c80917cd","size":75903,"duration":24,"mp3Url":"https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-voice-mp3/373ef3f0-1cde-4bd2-9731-ff715c9ea503.mp3","decodeStatus":2,"text":"哈喽。宝子老师每次看到咱们认真完成寒存的学习都感到退。别高兴哈。说明咱们是一个对自己有要求的小朋友坚持就是胜利老师也传授给咱们。们一个快速定位易缩点的方法，那就是海豚的精选题单这个可整颗年龄度级龄龄。几都容易出错的知识点，咱们今天学习的话就可以更高效的来鼻人前面哟。","contentType":"VOICE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773657296,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1032640","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"康博妈妈，新的一周又开始咯，完成本周内容之前老师还是先给咱们总结一下康博上周的学习情况，学校的重点海豚已经帮助孩子学会30%啦！～同时老师看到孩子上周学了特别久，也说明咱们宝贝的学习态度是特别端正的，如果咱们能坚持利用海豚把学校的内容做好巩固，我也相信康博会取得更大的进步~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773657292,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1030871","content":{"messageType":14,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"bigPicture":{"url":"https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/1836799_b83_md5_ddc2f121cae5d23c85c82af43d8919f1.png","md5":"ddc2f121cae5d23c85c82af43d8919f1","size":251334},"smallPicture":null,"contentType":"PICTURE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773561858,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1030869","content":{"messageType":16,"flag":0,"senderName":null,"time":0,"url":"https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-encoder/audio/35077162/35077162-847e-42ed-834d-a0df2c53a6ba.amr","md5":"111850c16a21c4685b7f598029358d4b","size":88238,"duration":27,"mp3Url":"https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-voice-mp3/35077162-847e-42ed-834d-a0df2c53a6ba.mp3","decodeStatus":2,"text":"宝子咱们的学习习惯是不是一直都是很好呀。老师对于咱们学习状态真的挺惊讶的。虽然咱们的基础掌握的还是挺不错的。刚开学至少已经超过百分之六十的同学了然后后续的话，我会帮咱们在重点功课一下进级内容，咱们可以先从资料库下面。标注的境界地方开始巩固哈，学会了咱们需要考试肯定就不成问题。万随时找我打卡哟。","contentType":"VOICE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773561852,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1030867","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"康博妈妈，老师又来给咱们做小报告啦，也让咱们知道孩子这两天的学习情况~看后台的数据咱宝掌握的还是很棒的，正确率非常高，特别是看视频的时候咱宝学习专注度真的很高，我也语音跟咱们个性化说下新学期的安排👇","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773561847,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1028463","content":{"messageType":14,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"bigPicture":{"url":"https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/7240990_t4j_md5_445cf64d745ec3e067dc5a5f77f1dd5d.png","md5":"445cf64d745ec3e067dc5a5f77f1dd5d","size":275541},"smallPicture":null,"contentType":"PICTURE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773477267,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1028461","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"老师夸孩子的语音咱们可以放给孩子听，老师也会持续关注孩子的学习情况的！另外，周末咱们记得提醒孩子把【本周错题】清理清理，您也记得在家长端给咱宝发一发海豚币鼓励金夸夸宝贝哦，这是操作截图👇","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773477263,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1028459","content":{"messageType":16,"flag":0,"senderName":null,"time":0,"url":"https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-encoder/audio/4cbcd7be/4cbcd7be-fadf-4feb-af24-1b0d180b6ca4.amr","md5":"1fb9bccfae2bcd31e078407f0170aed2","size":91687,"duration":28,"mp3Url":"https://dora-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/dora-voice-mp3/4cbcd7be-fadf-4feb-af24-1b0d180b6ca4.mp3","decodeStatus":2,"text":"哈喽。宝子老师专片跟你发条语音想好好夸夸你其实新学习有好多小朋友。都松懈了，但看到咱们周末还自觉来海豚学习，并且这周还学的这么久老师特别开心心。行哈，也真的为你感到骄傲。希望咱们后面的话一定要保持住自觉学习的好习惯，当然啦。这个过程中。如果说咱们遇到了任何问题，千万别忘了随时找老师，然后没有问题的话也可以多找老师聊聊天。老师特别期待和你沟通哟。","contentType":"VOICE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773477259,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1028457","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"康博妈妈，今天周六啦~老师在检查学习的时候，非常开心看到康博有新学的内容，忍不住想夸夸孩子，因为新学期的知识点会比较综合，昨天还有家长跟我反馈说太难了孩子不想做，转头看到咱孩子这个学习时长，比上周要更认真！我更想为咱们迎难而上的勇气点赞了，学了这么久宝贝也辛苦了，咱们别忘了好好夸夸他，跟孩子说一声老师一直在持续关注他哟","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773477254,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1026552","content":{"messageType":14,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"bigPicture":{"url":"https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/9740915_zln_md5_b255a0b9d44614714738c4ea3a5ac1f4.png","md5":"b255a0b9d44614714738c4ea3a5ac1f4","size":1956953},"smallPicture":null,"contentType":"PICTURE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773405720,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1026547","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"对了康博妈妈，为了增加孩子的学习意愿度，小白专门为孩子设置了完习挑战哦[愉快]！详细内容在图片里面，孩子从本周开始算起，只要能够连续4周【全环节】完习至少1门学科，就可以额外获得500海豚币的奖励哦~[奋斗]\n\n咱们让孩子把习惯保持好，好好利用起来吧！","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773405710,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1024401","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"前期学习习惯的养成是特别重要的，咱们康博做的非常好，所以也别忘了夸夸孩子哈，目前已经进入新的学期，面对新的征程难免会有一些问题，但我可以说我对咱们宝贝有百分百的信心，这个关头千万不能退缩，咱们沉下心坚持前进，我也会陪着咱们一起，也请您多给孩子一些鼓励，我们一起努力！","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773389441,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1024399","content":{"messageType":14,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"bigPicture":{"url":"https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/9396538_ckx_md5_f6c5a9dd7001c18dceef7de1e5559af5.png","md5":"f6c5a9dd7001c18dceef7de1e5559af5","size":453095},"smallPicture":null,"contentType":"PICTURE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773389437,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1024397","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"另外也跟咱们说一下，步入下学期之后知识点的难度也会慢慢提高，海豚也会给咱们准备一些考点内容，所以后续咱们一定要关注错题，也别忘了完成错题本里的【举一反三】内容哦，这个功能不仅可以实时收录孩子在学习计划上做错的题目，还能给孩子练习同类型的题目，保证孩子真正学懂吃透薄弱点，我截图发给您~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773389434,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1024395","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"本周还没结束宝贝就领先一步，成为走在前面的黑马了哟，并且本周已经按照要求认认真真学了至少50分钟以上啦，老师看到这个时长都吓了一跳，说明咱们已经有把海豚认真的利用起来了呢！","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773389430,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1024393","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"康博妈妈，老师后台看到孩子来海豚学习啦，也简单跟您反馈一下~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773389429,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1024144","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"学完之后，给我说一下，老师来检查一下，确认没有问题之后，咱们就可以开启下一个阶段学习了","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773378277,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1024142","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"咱们把剩下的内容要补上，今天晚上的话几点来学呢？","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773378240,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1024140","content":{"messageType":14,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"bigPicture":{"url":"https://emon-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/message/emon-chat-img-origin/59b9db95ab6d8533608c0dfdaf332547.jpg","md5":"5008a8391e3bef39d136240e064d1cc8","size":46295},"smallPicture":{"url":"https://emon-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/message/emon-chat-img-thumb/59b9db95ab6d8533608c0dfdaf332547.jpg","md5":"0b48fa75b104f3bc0e643c12972ba134","size":9910},"contentType":"PICTURE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773378225,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemote