me":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"另外孩子刚刚到老师的班上，这两天也没联系上您，还没来得及跟您沟通孩子的情况嘛[可怜]，等周五上班了我会跟您和孩子再1v1沟通一下，手把手教孩子怎么学海豚[拥抱]，周三、四您有任何问题，直接给老师打电话就好，我的电话是17512476287，您可以备注一下，另外，这周的答疑课咱们也别忘了预约哈[玫瑰]","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773150674,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1019699","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"康博妈妈，我怕我不上班的时候您联系不上我着急，就跟您同步一下我的放假时间，老师是周三周四休息，周五下午一点半开始上班~不过您放心，您有问题微信跟我留言就好，我只要看到了都会第一时间解决咱们的问题[爱心]孩子这两天需要学习的内容我都提前安排好了，孩子可以直接点开学习计划，有不懂的给我留言[社会社会][爱心]","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773150671,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1015530","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"好滴，那老师周中来看哈~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773057553,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"7881303161056596","receiverRemoteId":"1688858421799034","messageRemoteId":"1015149","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"天天学","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773057149,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1014135","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777728,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":1013871,"content":"咱们看每周几几点来学习~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773056102,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1014115","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"这个只是给孩子看一下数学的学习安排哈，其他的孩子在海豚学习计划APP可以看到~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773056079,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"7881303161056596","receiverRemoteId":"1688858421799034","messageRemoteId":"1013966","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"没有语文和英语课吗","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773055901,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"7881303161056596","receiverRemoteId":"1688858421799034","messageRemoteId":"1013929","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"周日学的","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773055843,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013871","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"另外也想问问咱们后面都是是周几学习海豚，定好后我就能在规定的学习时间到点督促孩子了。您看咱们周几来学呢？","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773055742,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013869","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"另外老师也想跟您说下咱们春季的学习规划👆考虑到大部分宝贝已经开学啦📚，在新的学期，海豚也希望宝贝们学的能够更加精准，做好下半学期的最后冲刺🏃，后面海豚会针对本学期的【重难点】【高频考题】【易错题型】去针对性的推送学习内容☺，做好与校内同步，后期每周我们都会针对当前的重点题型进行直播答疑讲解，帮助孩子们能更牢固的掌握知识点内容，并搭配新课改的真题帮助宝贝提前适应新知识点的吸收，更好的衔接新学期，领跑新起点！","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773055739,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013867","content":{"messageType":14,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"bigPicture":{"url":"https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/5666389_o5s_md5_974adb6fa1e019b926a9e725d7af8950.png","md5":"974adb6fa1e019b926a9e725d7af8950","size":1528953},"smallPicture":null,"contentType":"PICTURE"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773055735,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013865","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"康博妈妈，咱们宝贝报名后的第一次课程已经学完了，以上是孩子的学习报告~\n宝贝在课堂中的表现还是很出乎老师意料的，不仅在知识探究中展现出对知识点的渴求、也在小试牛刀中表现了对题目的严谨，老师非常开心能够看到宝贝有这么好的开始！☺","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773055731,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013863","content":{"messageType":13,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"title":"03.02-03.08 自习报告","linkUrl":"https://aries.yuanfudao.com/web/aries-web-pages/weekly.html?token=rfG1-3IloO3K4iZyR9iBlqgC34F9YmOSnng1FpXLSdKt7XALx0u9fIOq3lUou85J3ghD29kJY8LZrpzJLzTHUQ==","imageUrl":"https://conan-online.fbcontent.cn/aries-oss-resource/web-assets/1790568_9qe.png","description":"从被动学到主动学：查收周周学习记录","contentType":"LINK_CARD"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773055728,"msgSource":2},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013543","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"您看完有任何不明确的可以直接问我","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773054202,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013541","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"另外，六年级是应试提分、实现反超的黄金阶段，若此时知识点不扎实，孩子将难以适应后期高强度的学习节奏，容易出现成绩滑坡，所以老师也跟咱们说一下海豚近期的学习安排👇\n春季课程会严格紧扣校内知识点，直击考试必考内容，搭配专属答疑课，把每个重难点都讲透、练扎实，帮孩子把知识网络彻底织密，不留知识漏洞。\n您放心让孩子跟着海豚学，让孩子从开学就稳步适应学习节奏，为这学期的稳步提升蓄力。后续孩子学习上有任何问题，都可以随时跟我沟通，我们一起帮孩子稳步提升！","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773054200,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013539","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"1.进入正式版学习后，咱们跟体验课的更新方式是不同的：正式课程是一周更新一次，每周一0点更新孩子一周的学习规划。也就是学习计划里面的内容，孩子只要一周之内学完即可\n2.正式版的学习方式：\n①优先学习【学习计划】，每个科目每周学习2个知识点，孩子可以在周中学习更新的知识点\n②再订正【错题本】，周末整理错题本练习和【举一反三】的错题，这样就能做到学习和复习兼顾，知识点掌握更牢固啦","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773054200,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013537","content":{"messageType":22,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"url":"https://emon-gallery-online.fbcontent.cn/message/emon-video-dir/9348F7EE92427342DBD511FC5E544EDB.mp4","md5":"9348F7EE92427342DBD511FC5E544EDB","size":0,"duration":273,"contentType":"VIDEO"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773054200,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013535","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"宝贝妈妈，这是我给您录制的视频，里面详细讲解了海豚正式版的学习注意事项和使用方式，很重要哦❕❕视频内会有具体学习的规划和学习位置指引\n您和宝贝一定要点开看看哈，看完记得回复老师【ok】~也给您总结提炼一下👇","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773054194,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013533","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"好嘞，老师已经给您备注好了~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773054179,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"7881303161056596","receiverRemoteId":"1688858421799034","messageRemoteId":"1013446","content":{"messageType":2,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"马康博15993796910","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773053352,"msgSource":1},{"senderRemoteId":"1688858421799034","receiverRemoteId":"7881303161056596","messageRemoteId":"1013429","content":{"messageType":0,"flag":16777216,"senderName":null,"time":0,"quoteMsgRemoteId":0,"content":"🤝您好，我是您在海豚ai学正式版会员的自习助理，之后孩子在海豚的学习就是我来负责了，在海豚自习遇到相关的使用问题，可以联系我！\n\n👇为了后续跟您沟通更加方便，请您提供以下信息：\n1.【报名手机号】：\n2.【孩子姓名】：\n\n 💓另外为了给孩子更有针对性的服务，给您更有效的建议，后面会给您发送一份问卷，麻烦您及时查看微信填写哦[握手]~","ats":[],"contentType":"TEXT"},"status":1,"createdTime":1773053316,"msgSource":1},{"sender